{"meta":{"format_version":"4.10","model_format":"free","box_uv":false},"name":"goblin_fire_pit","model_identifier":"goblin_fire_pit","visible_box":[1,1,0],"variable_placeholders":"","variable_placeholder_buttons":[],"timeline_setups":[],"unhandled_root_fields":{"description":"# goblin_fire_pit\n\nGoblin fire pit: a sunken smoky pit ringed with rough stones and bones, a crooked spit with a charred carcass, smoke marked for the game.\n\n- Footprint: 4 x 4 columns (64 x 64 units, 1.80 x 1.80 m), centred on the origin, front (door side) faces -Z.\n- Finished bounds: x -34..38, y -0..28, z -22..29 units.\n- Texture: 128 x 128, 1 px per unit, square pixels, nearest filtering. Every visible face has its own texture region painted with its material at world position (seams line up across faces); identical faces share a region; construction and ruined pieces map into the region of the face they were cut from. No cube is cut to fit the texture.\n- Cubes: finished 20, construction_0 16, construction_33 16, construction_66 13, ruined 27 (10 rotated: roof slabs and a few leaning props).\n\n## Hit box\n\n- 56 x 28 x 56 centred at the origin\n\n## State group sets (children of `root`; show exactly one)\n\n- `finished`: the finished building (visible by default).\n- `construction_0`, `construction_33`, `construction_66`: build progress at 0 %, 33 % and 66 % (staked outline and scaffold, then walls rising inside scaffold, then full frame with roof rafters).\n- `ruined`: collapsed shell, broken walls, rubble, fallen roof (use with `_damaged.png`, or `_abandoned.png` for F7 abandoned buildings).\n- `goblin_fire_pit_damaged.png`: damaged texture (scorch, holes, cracks) for the same UVs; works on every group set.\n- `goblin_fire_pit_abandoned.png`: abandoned look (damage plus moss, faded cloth, cold fires) = `abandoned_goblin_fire_pit` together with the `ruined` set or the finished set.\n\n## Attachment and effect points (empty groups)\n\n- `fx_flame` at (0, 9, 0)\n- `fx_smoke` at (0, 20, 0)\n"},"resolution":{"width":128,"height":128},"elements":[{"name":"pit","box_uv":false,"rescale":false,"locked":false,"light_emission":0,"render_order":"default","allow_mirror_modeling":true,"from":[-16.0,0.0,-16.0],"to":[16.0,0.4,16.0],"autouv":0,"color":0,"inflate":0.0,"origin":[0.0,0.0,0.0],"faces":{"north":{"uv":[51.0,78.6,83.0,79.0],"texture":0},"east":{"uv":[51.0,78.6,83.0,79.0],"texture":0},"south":{"uv":[51.0,78.6,83.0,79.0],"texture":0},"west":{"uv":[51.0,78.6,83.0,79.0],"texture":0},"up":{"uv":[0.0,0.0,32.0,32.0],"texture":0},"down":{"uv":[0.0,0.0,32.0,32.0],"texture":0}},"type":"cube","uuid":"531728d5-a48f-5c92-ad6f-568d2f661777"},{"name":"stone0","box_uv":false,"rescale":false,"locked":false,"light_emission":0,"render_order":"default","allow_mirror_modeling":true,"from":[17.0,0.0,-3.0],"to":[23.0,4.0,3.0],"autouv":0,"color":0,"inflate":0.0,"origin":[0.0,0.0,0.0],"faces":{"north":{"uv":[28.0,71.0,34.0,75.0],"texture":0},"east":{"uv":[34.0,71.0,40.0,75.0],"texture":0},"south":{"uv":[28.0,71.0,34.0,75.0],"texture":0},"west":{"uv":[34.0,71.0,40.0,75.0],"texture":0},"up":{"uv":[42.0,60.0,48.0,66.0],"texture":0},"down":{"uv":[42.0,60.0,48.0,66.0],"texture":0}},"type":"cube","uuid":"d8b5ed80-b442-5827-999d-9c372f52455e"},{"name":"stone1","box_uv":false,"rescale":false,"locked":false,"light_emission":0,"render_order":"default","allow_mirror_modeling":true,"from":[13.1803,0.0,8.7557],"to":[19.1803,6.0,14.7557],"autouv":0,"color":0,"inflate":0.0,"origin":[0.0,0.0,0.0],"faces":{"north":{"uv":[112.1803,53.0,118.1803,59.0],"texture":0},"east":{"uv":[119.7557,53.0,125.7557,59.0],"texture":0},"south":{"uv":[112.1803,53.0,118.1803,59.0],"texture":0},"west":{"uv":[119.7557,53.0,125.7557,59.0],"texture":0},"up":{"uv":[95.1803,45.7557,101.1803,51.7557],"texture":0},"down":{"uv":[95.1803,45.7557,101.1803,51.7557],"texture":0}},"type":"cube","uuid":"fa019797-ee60-58c7-8ac0-c0eb15b7f12b"},{"name":"stone2","box_uv":false,"rescale":false,"locked":false,"light_emission":0,"r